# Swagger UI - FastAPI **0.120.2**

<img width="2494" height="1408" alt="Screenshot from 2025-10-31 11-02-46" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d539328-3e2b-4277-8c00-bc1a4be49b93" />

